<h1>Documentation</h1>

<p>Elixir MCP records the Clash Royale history the official API doesn't keep,
and serves it to your own agent. If you just want that working, the
<a href="/docs/quickstart">quickstart</a> is five minutes. If you are trying to
work out whether you want a personal connection or an agent for your clan,
read <a href="/docs/connections">users, agents and integrations</a> first —
it's the distinction everything else rests on. Building a client or an agent?
The <a href="/docs/protocol">protocol reference</a>, <a href="/docs/agents">agent guide</a>
and <a href="/docs/limits">limits</a> are written for you.</p>

